      <h1>Welcome To Educare's Design System</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col pt-3">
      <span class="h5">Your Shortcut to Stunning Education Websites</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Educare (Vartheme BS5 Educare) is a targeted site template built by <a href="https://www.vardot.com/en">Vardot</a> to kickstart education websites — universities, schools, and other learning institutions. Built on <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/varbase">Varbase</a> and Bootstrap 5 with Single Directory Components (SDC), it lets you craft beautiful, consistent education websites with lightning speed. Whether you're launching a university portal or a school site, Educare simplifies the process with reusable components and seamless asset management, saving you time and effort.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>How to Use It</h2>
    </div>
