  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Ready to build smarter? Educare's component-based approach makes creating and managing education website assets a breeze. Dive into our intuitive system, explore the Figma file for design inspiration, and start turning your ideas into reality. Perfect for developers and designers building for universities and schools alike!</p>
      <div class="mt-5 bg-light p-5 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center w-25">
        <img class="d-flex mx-auto d-block" src="/components/foundation/images/assets/figma-logo.svg" width="50px" alt="Figma icon logo" />
